# Walkthrough - District Immunisation Web Application & 2023 Export

The **District Immunisation Analytics** dashboard has been updated to include instant 2023 CSV table downloads both directly on the website UI and as a workspace file.

## Summary of Accomplishments

1. **Website Download Feature (`index.html` & `app.js`)**:
   - Added a **"📥 Download 2023 CSV Table"** action button in the dashboard control bar.
   - Automatically generates and downloads a structured CSV file (`district_immunisation_2023.csv`) containing the filtered dataset, calculated coverage rates, and source provenance.
   - Button text updates dynamically when switching years (`Download 2022 CSV Table`, `Download 2023 CSV Table`, `Download All Years CSV Table`).

2. **Standalone 2023 CSV File**:
   - Created [district_immunisation_2023.csv](file:///tmp/io-agy-smoke-001-IBPLLz/district_immunisation_2023.csv) in the project root directory for direct access.

---

